  "properties": {
    "title": "QGIS 4 is coming and my plugins will break",
    "description": "Will plugins really break when migrating them to QGIS 4?\n\nThe title of this talk may sound intimidating, but it reflects a very common concern. Will the plugins I\u2019ve previously developed break in QGIS 4? Do I need to rewrite every line of code, or will plugins continue to work with only minor adjustments?\r\n\r\nThis talk is aimed at those familiar with plugin development in QGIS 3 who want to get started with QGIS 4. You\u2019ll learn what you really need to know when migrating. And then you will decide for yourself: is the process really as scary as the title of this talk? ;-)",
    "start_datetime": "2026-09-01T04:30:00Z",
    "end_datetime": "2026-09-01T05:00:00Z",
